        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Screen Door Or Storm Door Complete Installation Kit, Acorn AZ1BI</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis installation kit comes with everything you need to install a new screen door or dress up an existing screen or storm door. It includes 3 door hinges, the door latchset with a lever on one side and a knob on the other plus a hydraulic door closer. It's a great bargain! Plus it is easy to install. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Acorn AZ1BI Complete Screen Door Set Includes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Three - 3\" High x 2-1/2\" Wide Surface Hinges</li>\r\n<li>1- Hydraulic Closer</li>\r\n<li>1- Complete <a href=\"/products/black-storm-door-lock-set-acorn-st9bi\"><b>Storm Door Latchset</b></a>--made up of 1 knob and 1 lever.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Acorn Screen Door Kit\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Smooth Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Inside Knob Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Rose Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Rose Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Case Length: 2-21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Case Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinges: 2\" x 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 7/8\" to 1-3/8\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Storm door latch includes slide lock, inside rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed - Reversible for in-swinging or out-swinging doors. Order just one kit per door - it's that easy! \r\n</p>",
